reviews.review:
PengPong Demo
pros:
//fast game with modern day graphics with easy controls that moves from location A to B to C and so on
//good amount of action and special effects
cons:
//some difficult battles/boss battles
//some overpowered enemies
//could use more powerups and loot
//sometimes too many enemies constantly spawn
//sometimes too many enemies fill the screen and make it difficult to evade
//upgrades require a lot of resources
//collecting resources are a grindfest
//enemies spawn to close to you
//game doesn't let you use more than one weapon at the same time
//a little repetitive

//good game
Personal Suggested Purchase Price: Free To Play
extra notes:
//you are an animated penguin or animal fighting against space aliens
//collect coins to buy upgrades and get stronger
//70's cartoon themed stages and enemies with some wild attacks
//random encounters like shops, mystery rewards, and slot machines that will change-up your gameplay
